Package: caretMultimodal
Title: Multimodal Late Fusion with 'caret'
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
        person("Josh", "Dyce", , "jpdyce@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
        person("Amrit", "Singh", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Extends the 'caret' framework to support late fusion workflows,
    enabling users to train models independently across multiple data modalities and combine their
    predictions into a single meta-model. Designed for developers, data scientists, and 
    biomedical researchers alike, 'caretMultimodal' aims to make late fusion ensemble modelling
    as accessible and flexible as single-dataset workflows in 'caret'. Late fusion methods are based on Wolpert (1992) 
    <doi:10.1016/S0893-6080(05)80023-1>.
